UPDATE public.listing_translations SET title='Two-Storey Shophouse in Pha Saeng, Ban Ta Khun', description='Property details

One two-storey shophouse unit in Pha Saeng, Ban Ta Khun, Surat Thani, on 30 sq.wah (120 sq.m.) of land under Nor Sor 3 Kor document no. 1074. The SAM page lists two bedrooms and one bathroom.

