Two shophouses numbered 31 and 33 fronting Somphot Chiang Mai 700 Pi Road 3029, Chang Phueak, Mueang Chiang Mai. Title deeds 88053, 88054, 90428, 90429 and 93151 cover a combined 42.7 sq.wah (170.8 sq.m.). SAM shows yellow planning zoning.

