Two-storey rental-room building with 20 rooms according to the SAM survey, without a stated house number, in Soi Huai Kapi 16, Huai Kapi, Mueang Chon Buri, Chon Buri. Deed 138457 covers 220 sq.wah (880 sq.m.). SAM announced price THB 7,935,000; asset 3A1362. This is a sale of the whole property, not an individual room rental offer.

