UPDATE public.listing_translations SET title='3-Storey Shophouse, Si Racha Nakhon 6', description='Property details

Three-storey shophouse with a mezzanine and roof terrace according to SAM''s survey, address 34, Si Racha Nakhon project, Si Racha Nakhon 6 Road, Si Racha subdistrict and district, Chon Buri. One title deed, 84489, covers 16 sq.wah (64 sq.m.). SAM lists three bedrooms and four bathrooms. Announced sale price THB 7,634,000; asset SL0184.

Rectangular plot with approximately four metres of western road frontage and 16 metres depth. Si Racha Nakhon 6 is described as a road within an approved subdivision, with approximately eight metres of concrete carriageway and a ten-metre right of way.

SAM''s registered acquisition describes an unnumbered three-storey shophouse, while the web address states number 34 and the survey includes a mezzanine and roof terrace. Verify the building number, registered structures and permits for additions against the actual property.

From Chon Buri toward Laem Chabang on Sukhumvit Road, pass Si Racha district office, the Provincial Electricity Authority and Robinson. Turn right into Si Racha Nakhon 3 and Si Racha Nakhon 6 for approximately 385 metres; the property is on the left.

Property notes

SAM reports red planning zoning and residential/commercial surroundings in central Si Racha, near Phyathai Hospital. Check permitted uses and relevant operating licences for the intended activity.

Navigation and map links agree on 13.168283, 100.928518. The latest building and interior photographs display 4 March 2026. Fourteen source images include street views, floor plans, plot plans and a location map. Total usable area, building age, parking capacity and occupancy are not published; confirm these and inspect current condition with SAM.

Price and contact

