UPDATE public.listing_translations SET title='Ten-Room Residential Building, Bang Sai', description='Property details

Whole-property sale of a single-storey residential row building surveyed as ten rooms, with a carport, numbered 197/7 Moo 1, Soi Thetsaban Sommut off Phiphit Road, Bang Sai, Mueang Chon Buri, Chon Buri. Three Chanote titles 48649, 48650 and 48651 total 192.5 sq.wah (770 sq.m.). SAM lists ten bedrooms and ten bathrooms. Announced price THB 6,087,000; asset 3A2163.

Residential and commercial surroundings near Wat Chong Lom Bang Sai, Chonburi City Pillar Shrine and Chonburi Provincial Court. Follow Phiphit Road from Bang Sai toward Chonburi Municipality; at Wat Chong Lom turn left into Soi Thetsaban Sommut for approximately 370 metres, property on the left.

Property notes

Material land-use disclosure: SAM reports that part of title 48651 is used as access for neighbouring plots, approximately 2 metres wide and 40 metres long, with a reported area of approximately 20.5 sq.wah. This is included in the total land area. Verify boundaries, access use and associated rights before offering; the source does not confirm registered easement details.

Polygonal plot with approximately 15 metres of eastern road frontage and maximum depth 41 metres. Registered acquisition describes a single-storey row building 197/7 and an unnumbered carport; the survey identifies ten rooms. SAM describes Soi Thetsaban Sommut as public, with approximately six metres concrete carriageway and eight metres right of way. SAM reports orange zoning and urban-community land under the Eastern Economic Corridor comprehensive planning rules.

Nineteen source images include the building, interiors, bathroom, carport, plot plans, neighbouring access strip and map. Building/interior photos display 16 June 2025. Inspect current roof, ceilings, electrical and plumbing condition. Rental income, tenant roll, occupancy, total usable area and parking capacity are not published.

Price and contact

SAM showed direct purchase and this price on 11 September 2026. Contact 02-686-1888, sales@sam.or.th or LINE @samline quoting 3A2163 to confirm availability, price, viewing and terms. Navigation and map agree on 13.378166, 100.984942.', seo_title='Ten-Room Residential Building, Bang Sai', search_text=lower(concat_ws(' ','Ten-Room Residential Building, Bang Sai','Property details

Whole-property sale of a single-storey residential row building surveyed as ten rooms, with a carport, numbered 197/7 Moo 1, Soi Thetsaban Sommut off Phiphit Road, Bang Sai, Mueang Chon Buri, Chon Buri. Three Chanote titles 48649, 48650 and 48651 total 192.5 sq.wah (770 sq.m.). SAM lists ten bedrooms and ten bathrooms. Announced price THB 6,087,000; asset 3A2163.

Residential and commercial surroundings near Wat Chong Lom Bang Sai, Chonburi City Pillar Shrine and Chonburi Provincial Court. Follow Phiphit Road from Bang Sai toward Chonburi Municipality; at Wat Chong Lom turn left into Soi Thetsaban Sommut for approximately 370 metres, property on the left.

Property notes

Material land-use disclosure: SAM reports that part of title 48651 is used as access for neighbouring plots, approximately 2 metres wide and 40 metres long, with a reported area of approximately 20.5 sq.wah. This is included in the total land area. Verify boundaries, access use and associated rights before offering; the source does not confirm registered easement details.

Polygonal plot with approximately 15 metres of eastern road frontage and maximum depth 41 metres. Registered acquisition describes a single-storey row building 197/7 and an unnumbered carport; the survey identifies ten rooms. SAM describes Soi Thetsaban Sommut as public, with approximately six metres concrete carriageway and eight metres right of way. SAM reports orange zoning and urban-community land under the Eastern Economic Corridor comprehensive planning rules.

